Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hi, is that for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.50,0:00:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm, it's from my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.86,0:00:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's what she writes:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.20,0:00:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Dear Elisabeth, it's been three years since we broke off contact.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,One night when we were both too upset.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.16,0:00:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Soon it's time to let it be forgotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.50,0:00:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Since then I've regretted the way I said things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.58,0:00:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And you must have seen some of your own faults too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Here's a bill;
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.98,0:00:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll give ten times that if you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.14,0:00:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,swallow your pride and visit your mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,She just doesn't get that I don't want her filthy damn money.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So, how about coming to The Mask tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.20,0:00:55.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.60,0:00:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll finish up here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.91,0:01:01.32,Default,,0,0,0,,then let's meet down at The Mask in fifteen minutes.
